It is an HEVC Annex B stream the hevc fuzz target found: a small x265 stream with its SEI removed and its slice data damaged so that cu_qp_delta_abs carries a long Exp-Golomb prefix. Decoding it once overflowed the sum of that prefix; the decoder now refuses it as an invalid cu_qp_delta_abs.
